    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/9a873733abe53869ef99f0598e6cda74.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/d67d8542ee6d881bdc9eaaada0a3f40a.poster.avif?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/d67d8542ee6d881bdc9eaaada0a3f40a.webm?t=1755312967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the past and the present of an artist who defies within demons, representing their creative distress in the form of a diary, in the form of video game projects. Dive into them, dive into ever-changing scenes, adapting to new controls and views, each representing the fragments of the bigger picture, and who knows\u2026 maybe you\u2019ll understand-\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/70479e6d70637f8687fd3fed99964f05.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/bc6a91cc905919044435e410b500dcf5.poster.avif?t=1755312967\" width=575 height=429 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/bc6a91cc905919044435e410b500dcf5.webm?t=1755312967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/5bf4c7b6268ce779a4463d1b27fd1372.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maybe you\u2019ll understand why Mr. Pubblety Meows is so important, the catalyst that started it all, the last and only heirloom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/2ce8dde1e4c9e5fdaf33119f5b48ead8.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/a34f6c7c564952a6dd8605c85afcaff4.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/9a873733abe53869ef99f0598e6cda74.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/d67d8542ee6d881bdc9eaaada0a3f40a.poster.avif?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/d67d8542ee6d881bdc9eaaada0a3f40a.webm?t=1755312967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the past and the present of an artist who defies within demons, representing their creative distress in the form of a diary, in the form of video game projects. Dive into them, dive into ever-changing scenes, adapting to new controls and views, each representing the fragments of the bigger picture, and who knows\u2026 maybe you\u2019ll understand-\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/70479e6d70637f8687fd3fed99964f05.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/bc6a91cc905919044435e410b500dcf5.poster.avif?t=1755312967\" width=575 height=429 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/bc6a91cc905919044435e410b500dcf5.webm?t=1755312967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/5bf4c7b6268ce779a4463d1b27fd1372.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maybe you\u2019ll understand why Mr. Pubblety Meows is so important, the catalyst that started it all, the last and only heirloom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/2ce8dde1e4c9e5fdaf33119f5b48ead8.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625080/extras/a34f6c7c564952a6dd8605c85afcaff4.webp?t=1755312967\" width=600 height=2 /></span></p>",
